{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38565","headline":"题湖城县西道中槐树 · 吴融","name":"题湖城县西道中槐树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"零落攲斜此路中，盛时曾识太平风。\n晓迷天仗归春苑，暮送鸾旗指洛宫。\n一自烟尘生蓟北，更无消息幸关东。\n而今只有孤根在，鸟啄虫穿没乱蓬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38565.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38565","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}